Student Management System 🎓

A simple Student Management System built using C++. This project helps manage student records easily.

Features
Add new students
View all students
Search students by ID
Delete student records
Save data using file handling
Technologies
C++
How to Run
Download the project.
Open the folder in VS Code.
Compile the code: g++ main.cpp -o student
Run the program: student.exe
Project Type

Beginner C++ Project
